<title>USA: Video Sentry sells system to Sun.</title>
<headline>Video Sentry sells system to Sun.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Sentry Corp said Friday it sold a patented SentryVision surveillance system to Sun Microsystems Inc. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>It said the system will be installed at Sun's Fremont, Calif. facility.</p>
<p>Video Sentry chief executive officer Robert Furst said this represents the company's first sale to the manufacturing sector of the high technology market.</p>
<p>	 ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
